<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-3/8 (FIM 266.45).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $57-3/8 (FIM 266.45).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR rose $0-7/8 to end at $57-3/8 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 266.45 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed up 9.30 markka at 268.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed flat at $34-3/4 on Wall Street on Tuesday. The price equals about 80.70 markka. In Helsinki on Tuesday, Valmet closed up 2.30 at 82.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Tuesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed flat at 90.00 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
